      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "No, please don't!\n\nClosed instances should stay closed and not imply a \"closed community\" where previous people can rejoin. This would be so confusing to see if some of my friends would join a closed instance i would like to go too. Maybe that instance was open for days and hundrets or thousends of people joined before. The instance might survive for days/weeks with people who are coming back in.",
