      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is such a weird feature to begin with. They could've just added an option to \"detach\" the instance from the group, and change its type. For example, a \"Group+\" instance could be turned into a \"Friends+\" instance after the event is finished.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
