  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, players cannot rejoin an instance when that has been closed, even if the disconnection was unexpected, such as a connection timeout or a client crash.\n\nThis problem makes it difficult to close the instance on for events such as first come first serve.\n\nNow these events respond like request to guest to change user status to \"Ask Me\" or \"Do Not Disturb\" when instance players max, but I think this situation should use close instance feature.\n\nHowever, currently the instance closing feature has a problem mentioned earlier, it needs the option to allow players to rejoin the instance if they have visited in the past.\n\n日本語要約\n\n現在のインスタンスクローズ機能は、一度クローズしたインスタンスにはタイムアウトやクラッシュといった不慮の事故によるものでもRejoinできず、先着制のイベントなどでこの機能を使うことが困難であるため、一度インスタンスに入った人はRejoinを許可する設定がほしいです。",
